    },
    {
      "text": "１ターンめで　そらへ　とびあがって\n２ターンめで　こうげきする。\nしっているまちに　いどうも　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "1턴째에 하늘을 날아올라\n2턴째에 공격한다.\n알고 있는 도시로 이동할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur s’envole au premier tour et frappe au\nsecond. Permet aussi de voler jusqu’à une ville\ndéjà visitée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Runde 1 fliegt der Angreifer empor und\nattackiert in Runde 2. Man kann damit zu\njedem bekannten Ort fliegen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Desactiva los sistemas de seguridad de la Base\nGalaxia. Por lo visto, perder esta tarjeta se\ncastiga severamente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si alza in volo per attaccare al turno\nseguente. Fuori dalla lotta permette di volare\nin città già visitate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user soars and then strikes\nits target on the next turn. This can\nalso be used to fly to any familiar town.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
